{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x2cce4c",
      "back_en": "Worst news first, I guess... The Mikado",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento, sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cce7c",
      "back_en": "indeed passed away.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente eufemístico correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cce9a",
      "back_en": "The city is in mourning, and the Generals' armies",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Pillars'' vira 'Generais'; aceitável dentro do termo Generais-Pilar."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd013",
      "back_en": "The popular rumor is that Oshtor killed",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd057",
      "back_en": "Oshtor... assassinated the Mikado? Killed my",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd0b1",
      "back_en": "My dear brother... even if the heavens",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd144",
      "back_en": "assassination attempt of the princess.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd195",
      "back_en": "critical condition.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd1cf",
      "back_en": "He NEVER--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento; 'would' omitido mas natural."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd1ea",
      "back_en": "H-He never... He'd never do such a horrible",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'He would...' vira 'Ele nunca...'; leve mudança aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd223",
      "back_en": "It's all right. Everyone here trusts in Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd278",
      "back_en": "So, where is Oshtor now?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd297",
      "back_en": "Oh, yes. He... was arrested.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd2bb",
      "back_en": "They're keeping him in custody.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd335",
      "back_en": "a conspirator.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd3a5",
      "back_en": "state.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento sem contexto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd3b3",
      "back_en": "Honoka killed my brother? No, that's...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd481",
      "back_en": "Not many know that we belong to Oshtor",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Continuação coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d2fab",
      "back_en": "My brother, the princess, Oshtor, Honoka...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3314",
      "back_en": "Lady Honoka, who asked me to relay a message.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3759",
      "back_en": "Lady Honoka hid me, thankfully, but...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d37b2",
      "back_en": "the Mikado, and she herself remains in hiding.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d387f",
      "back_en": "L-Lord... Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3891",
      "back_en": "That... That's a lie. My brother would never",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d38d1",
      "back_en": "It was you...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Forma 'tu'; inconsistente com 'você' na próxima fala do mesmo personagem."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d38e0",
      "back_en": "YOU are the conspires against him!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Erro gramatical: 'VOCÊ é o conspira'; falta 'quem'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3967",
      "back_en": "Unhand me! It's her! She's the one responsible!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3997",
      "back_en": "...I do not deny what you say.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3a5b",
      "back_en": "the memory is wrapped (masc.) in thick fog.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Concordância: 'a memória está envolto' deveria ser 'envolta'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3aaf",
      "back_en": "trance, and merely THOUGHT it was Lord Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3b39",
      "back_en": "Oshtor himself.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3c43",
      "back_en": "Haku--and asks that I relay a message to you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3c7c",
      "back_en": "Her Highness is still in danger.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3d23",
      "back_en": "That is the message milady sends.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3dc8",
      "back_en": "Where exactly is Honoka now?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3f2a",
      "back_en": "...Our connection with Mother has been severed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3f5c",
      "back_en": "Either it got blocked (masc.) somehow, or she...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'ficou bloqueado' não concorda com 'conexão' (fem.)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3ff5",
      "back_en": "Do you know where Oshtor is?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4092",
      "back_en": "Vurai is holding him in the underground prison.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d40f5",
      "back_en": "about Lady Honoka's whereabouts.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4116",
      "back_en": "Vurai... one of the Eight Pillar Generals.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d44ac",
      "back_en": "You don't even believe you'll succeed, do you?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4a4b",
      "back_en": "Yamato's state secrets, doesn't (she/you)?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Tag question mantida em contexto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4df9",
      "back_en": "You're reliable as always, Haku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4f7e",
      "back_en": "powers to reach Oshtor's prison undetected?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d509b",
      "back_en": "to move between planes and trace our paths.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d51cd",
      "back_en": "They can move about within...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d521d",
      "back_en": "reaching the palace, we'll be able to rescue Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d527f",
      "back_en": "the princess' exact location and rescue her.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d54fb",
      "back_en": "pull this off as long as you reach the palace?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5605",
      "back_en": "Mother--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d560e",
      "back_en": "...Mother what?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Trocadilho 'Moth' perdido, mas sentido ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5685",
      "back_en": "Or is it possible you simply didn't notice me?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5773",
      "back_en": "tattling on little girls who play at rescuer.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d58d0",
      "back_en": "Isn't it siblings' duty to help each",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'lot' como 'dever' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d58fe",
      "back_en": "other in a bind? Dear little Kuon seems to need",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d59c1",
      "back_en": "Karulau's more the type to throw Kuon off a cliff",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5ac4",
      "back_en": "to help her. I require no compensation.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'little sister' implícito; continuação ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5b70",
      "back_en": "who she is.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d60af",
      "back_en": "The fewer people in danger, the better.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6138",
      "back_en": "Everyone's mind is already made up.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d61e7",
      "back_en": "At the Master's side is our true place in this",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Vocativo vira 3ª pessoa; condiz com tom formal."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6677",
      "back_en": "and throw away. Is it clear?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d67cb",
      "back_en": "Wait! I've never heard even a WHISPER of such a route",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d685b",
      "back_en": "aren't you? Better hurry along now.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6cea",
      "back_en": "Master, your hand...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6cff",
      "back_en": "Touch your skin to ours.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6d18",
      "back_en": "Our bodies shall embrace yours wholly.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6ebc",
      "back_en": "not to leave her here, considering th--?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d7219",
      "back_en": "justice reveals all.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d7249",
      "back_en": "Upon the name of the Evenkuruga.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d73f2",
      "back_en": "Mother.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d749e",
      "back_en": "come straight home, my daughter. No detours.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'young lady' vira 'minha filha'; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d74d6",
      "back_en": "Whatever the outcome, it's... likely that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d7507",
      "back_en": "we'll never be able to come back here.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d75db",
      "back_en": "Are you certain you don't want to go with them?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d7645",
      "back_en": "I believe Kuon no longer needs my protection.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d76f6",
      "back_en": "What a strange man. He almost reminds me of...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d7725",
      "back_en": "Of whom?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Fonte usa 'what'; alvo 'De quem?' muda para pessoa."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d775c",
      "back_en": "for a time gone by.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ccb40",
      "back_en": "Any particular reason the gate would be",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ccce4",
      "back_en": "this one.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento sem contexto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cce94",
      "back_en": "No...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ccecd",
      "back_en": "are being barred from entry for the duration.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'pela duração' levemente truncado mas claro."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ccf27",
      "back_en": "it's mere conjecture with some basis,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'substantiated' bem rendido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd086",
      "back_en": "brother?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd6d1",
      "back_en": "merchants.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd908",
      "back_en": "mourning.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2cd94d",
      "back_en": "There are people on the streets, but they all",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d2379",
      "back_en": "Hey, Rulie! Can you bring something to eat",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d25ef",
      "back_en": "Welcome back, Dad!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d2c90",
      "back_en": "You're... not going to read it?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d2f42",
      "back_en": "Our plan from here on, huh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3a1c",
      "back_en": "Lord Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3c71",
      "back_en": "A message?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d3e1d",
      "back_en": "there before I realized where I was.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4221",
      "back_en": "If those men are leading the interrogation,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d42b1",
      "back_en": "I've been gathering information on the security",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4385",
      "back_en": "You're not going.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d447f",
      "back_en": "How can you say that with such confidence?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d47ad",
      "back_en": "a search.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4b7d",
      "back_en": "Easy, easy. I'm not saying we'll just",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d4e4e",
      "back_en": "and plot an escape route.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d50f8",
      "back_en": "and we'll move (invistos?).",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'invistos' não é palavra; deveria ser 'invisíveis'/'sem sermos vistos'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d519b",
      "back_en": "maybe?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5567",
      "back_en": "I turn and find Karulau, smiling confidently,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5648",
      "back_en": "Oh? I don't think I made any effort to hide",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5930",
      "back_en": "my help.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d5d25",
      "back_en": "sister.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6070",
      "back_en": "less of you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento, sentido ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6302",
      "back_en": "Save the imperial house from ruin--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6365",
      "back_en": "We're ready whenever you like.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6461",
      "back_en": "Karulau leads us down the stairs to the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d65c8",
      "back_en": "I hear water flowing in there.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6646",
      "back_en": "When all is said and done, destroy this",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'tear up' como 'destrua'; aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6e8a",
      "back_en": "It was no trouble, but... are you sure you want",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d6fbe",
      "back_en": "Please, ah, remember to cover up well in bed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d7017",
      "back_en": "Yes, we'll see each other later.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Leve mudança 'I will see you'→'voltamos a nos ver'; ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d72cb",
      "back_en": "We're just going out for a walk.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d74cf",
      "back_en": "...OK.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d7792",
      "back_en": "Time truly does slip us by.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK, leve estranheza em 'de verdade'."
    }
  ],
